      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of setting the wake mask, can we just assert and de-assert the wake line? Basically setting of wake mask and then setting the host event bit is achieving the same thing. In order to ensure that HANG_DETECT gets reported, you will have to add it to ALWAYS_REPORT mask.\n\nThat way, we don\u0027t have to set the wake mask in different places i.e. one on sleep state transition and over here.",
